    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d365">

                <pb facs="0594" n="576" xml:id="pg576"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.50 Recovery/10–1548: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Political Adviser</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Joyce</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">at Trieste, to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Trieste</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-10-15T12:00:00+01:00">October 15,
                            1948—noon.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p> Niact 679. Remytel 673 of October 14.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d365-f1"/> General
                    Airey and I at 9 o’clock this morning, Trieste time, signed bilateral agreement
                    covering participation British/US zone FTT in Europe Recovery Program.<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d365-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>Sent Department 679, repeated Paris 117.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Joyce</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
